{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X 的高亮词串虽然不是完整句子，但能连贯还原从试探亲近、得到接纳、渴望靠近，到害怕失去、最终不再隐藏喜欢的过程；Y 的大块多用「触动」「支撑」「更宽广的体验」等抽象概念，亲密的幸福与失去它的痛楚这一核心被冲淡。small、fine、human：X 的旁注有更多具体而有辨识度的体验，如「温柔的刺」「还没有失去什么，就已经舍不得」「白天和某个人相处得很好，独处时心头却泛酸」，补充也较贴合当下情境；Y 则有「独自承受自己感受」「撤回此前对它的承认」「比个人愿望更大的体验」等生硬、摘要腔或抽象化表达。concise、load：X 虽然旁注丰富，但不同屏幕的大字主要推进了新的关系变化，高亮短语也容易扫读；Y 看似简短，实际反复改写安稳、支撑、抽离、无法留住等相近意思，而且每屏常有三四块较长的大字，尤其在18秒、27秒的屏幕上，扫读负担明显更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f47b19f8-61c6-4ffa-ad35-59dec86bffd0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261112T035452030393Z", "elapsed_seconds": 140.329, "completed_utc": "2026-11-12T03:57:12.373135+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8b2e1a1cb26c1be8062cbea2db41eb3402843f1911a3efea640cd22da06bc375", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de